{"v":[{"a":["وَٱلۡفَجۡرِ"],"t":"By the daybreak","l":"Wa Al-Fajri","w":[["wal-fajri","By the dawn"]]},{"a":["وَلَيَالٍ","عَشۡرٖ"],"t":"And ten nights","l":"Wa Layalin `Ashrin","w":[["walayālin","And the nights"],["ʿashrin","ten"]]},{"a":["وَٱلشَّفۡعِ","وَٱلۡوَتۡرِ"],"t":"And the even and the odd","l":"Wa Ash-Shaf`i Wa Al-Watri","w":[["wal-shafʿi","And the even"],["wal-watri","and the odd"]]},{"a":["وَٱلَّيۡلِ","إِذَا","يَسۡرِ"],"t":"And the night as it recedes","l":"Wa Al-Layli 'Idha Yasri","w":[["wa-al-layli","And the night"],["idhā","when"],["yasri","it passes"]]},{"a":["هَلۡ","فِي","ذَٰلِكَ","قَسَمٞ","لِّذِي","حِجۡرٍ"],"t":"Is there in this an oath for a rational person","l":"Hal Fi Dhalika Qasamun Lidhi Hijrin","w":[["hal","Is"],["fī","in"],["dhālika","that"],["qasamun","(not) an oath"],["lidhī","for those"],["ḥij'rin","who understand"]]},{"a":["أَلَمۡ","تَرَ","كَيۡفَ","فَعَلَ","رَبُّكَ","بِعَادٍ"],"t":"Have you not seen how your Lord dealt with Aad","l":"Alam Tara Kayfa Fa`ala Rabbuka Bi`adin","w":[["alam","Did not"],["tara","you see"],["kayfa","how"],["faʿala","dealt"],["rabbuka","your Lord"],["biʿādin","with Aad"]]},{"a":["إِرَمَ","ذَاتِ","ٱلۡعِمَادِ"],"t":"Erum of the pillars","l":"Irama Dhati Al-`Imadi","w":[["irama","Iram"],["dhāti","possessors (of)"],["l-ʿimādi","lofty pillars"]]},{"a":["ٱلَّتِي","لَمۡ","يُخۡلَقۡ","مِثۡلُهَا","فِي","ٱلۡبِلَٰدِ"],"t":"The like of which was never created in the land","l":"Allati Lam Yukhlaq Mithluha Fi Al-Biladi","w":[["allatī","Which"],["lam","not"],["yukh'laq","had been created"],["mith'luhā","like them"],["fī","in"],["l-bilādi","the cities"]]},{"a":["وَثَمُودَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","جَابُواْ","ٱلصَّخۡرَ","بِٱلۡوَادِ"],"t":"And Thamood—those who carved the rocks in the valley","l":"Wa Thamuda Al-Ladhina Jabu As-Sakhra Bil-Wadi","w":[["wathamūda","And Thamud"],["alladhīna","who"],["jābū","carved out"],["l-ṣakhra","the rocks"],["bil-wādi","in the valley"]]},{"a":["وَفِرۡعَوۡنَ","ذِي","ٱلۡأَوۡتَادِ"],"t":"And Pharaoh of the Stakes","l":"Wa Fir`awna Dhi Al-'Awtadi","w":[["wafir'ʿawna","And Firaun"],["dhī","owner of"],["l-awtādi","stakes"]]},{"a":["ٱلَّذِينَ","طَغَوۡاْ","فِي","ٱلۡبِلَٰدِ"],"t":"Those who committed excesses in the lands","l":"Al-Ladhina Taghaw Fi Al-Biladi","w":[["alladhīna","Who"],["ṭaghaw","transgressed"],["fī","in"],["l-bilādi","the lands"]]},{"a":["فَأَكۡثَرُواْ","فِيهَا","ٱلۡفَسَادَ"],"t":"And spread much corruption therein","l":"Fa'aktharu Fiha Al-Fasada","w":[["fa-aktharū","And (made) much"],["fīhā","therein"],["l-fasāda","corruption"]]},{"a":["فَصَبَّ","عَلَيۡهِمۡ","رَبُّكَ","سَوۡطَ","عَذَابٍ"],"t":"So your Lord poured down upon them a scourge of punishment","l":"Fasabba `Alayhim Rabbuka Sawta `Adhabin","w":[["faṣabba","So poured"],["ʿalayhim","on them"],["rabbuka","your Lord"],["sawṭa","scourge"],["ʿadhābin","(of) punishment"]]},{"a":["إِنَّ","رَبَّكَ","لَبِٱلۡمِرۡصَادِ"],"t":"Your Lord is on the lookout","l":"Inna Rabbaka Labialmirsadi","w":[["inna","Indeed"],["rabbaka","your Lord"],["labil-mir'ṣādi","(is) surely Ever Watchful"]]},{"a":["فَأَمَّا","ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ","إِذَا","مَا","ٱبۡتَلَىٰهُ","رَبُّهُۥ","فَأَكۡرَمَهُۥ","وَنَعَّمَهُۥ","فَيَقُولُ","رَبِّيٓ","أَكۡرَمَنِ"],"t":"As for man, whenever his Lord tests him, and honors him, and prospers him, he says, “My Lord has honored me.”","l":"Fa'amma Al-'Insanu 'Idha Ma Abtalahu Rabbuhu Fa'akramahu Wa Na``amahu Fayaqulu Rabbi 'Akramani","w":[["fa-ammā","And as for"],["l-insānu","man"],["idhā","when"],["mā","does"],["ib'talāhu","try him"],["rabbuhu","his Lord"],["fa-akramahu","and is generous to him"],["wanaʿʿamahu","and favors him"],["fayaqūlu","he says"],["rabbī","My Lord"],["akramani","has honored me"]]},{"a":["وَأَمَّآ","إِذَا","مَا","ٱبۡتَلَىٰهُ","فَقَدَرَ","عَلَيۡهِ","رِزۡقَهُۥ","فَيَقُولُ","رَبِّيٓ","أَهَٰنَنِ"],"t":"But whenever He tests him, and restricts his livelihood for him, he says, “My Lord has insulted me.”","l":"Wa 'Amma 'Idha Ma Abtalahu Faqadara `Alayhi Rizqahu Fayaqulu Rabbi 'Ahanani","w":[["wa-ammā","But"],["idhā","when"],["mā","does"],["ib'talāhu","He try him"],["faqadara","and restricts"],["ʿalayhi","for him"],["riz'qahu","his provision"],["fayaqūlu","then he says"],["rabbī","My Lord"],["ahānani","(has) humiliated me"]]},{"a":["كَلَّاۖ","بَل","لَّا","تُكۡرِمُونَ","ٱلۡيَتِيمَ"],"t":"Not at all. But you do not honor the orphan","l":"Kalla Bal La Tukrimuna Al-Yatima","w":[["kallā","Nay"],["bal","But"],["lā","not"],["tuk'rimūna","you honor"],["l-yatīma","the orphan"]]},{"a":["وَلَا","تَحَـٰٓضُّونَ","عَلَىٰ","طَعَامِ","ٱلۡمِسۡكِينِ"],"t":"And you do not urge the feeding of the poor","l":"Wa La Tahađđuna `Ala Ta`ami Al-Miskini","w":[["walā","And not"],["taḥāḍḍūna","you feel the urge"],["ʿalā","to"],["ṭaʿāmi","feed"],["l-mis'kīni","the poor"]]},{"a":["وَتَأۡكُلُونَ","ٱلتُّرَاثَ","أَكۡلٗا","لَّمّٗا"],"t":"And you devour inheritance with all greed","l":"Wa Ta'kuluna At-Turatha 'Aklaan Lammaan","w":[["watakulūna","And you consume"],["l-turātha","the inheritance"],["aklan","devouring"],["lamman","altogether"]]},{"a":["وَتُحِبُّونَ","ٱلۡمَالَ","حُبّٗا","جَمّٗا"],"t":"And you love wealth with immense love","l":"Wa Tuhibbuna Al-Mala Hubbaan Jammaan","w":[["watuḥibbūna","And you love"],["l-māla","wealth"],["ḥubban","(with) love"],["jamman","immense"]]},{"a":["كَلَّآۖ","إِذَا","دُكَّتِ","ٱلۡأَرۡضُ","دَكّٗا","دَكّٗا"],"t":"No—when the earth is leveled, pounded, and crushed","l":"Kalla 'Idha Dukkati Al-'Arđu Dakkaan Dakkaan","w":[["kallā","Nay"],["idhā","When"],["dukkati","is leveled"],["l-arḍu","the earth"],["dakkan","pounded"],["dakkan","(and) crushed"]]},{"a":["وَجَآءَ","رَبُّكَ","وَٱلۡمَلَكُ","صَفّٗا","صَفّٗا"],"t":"And your Lord comes, with the angels, row after row","l":"Wa Ja'a Rabbuka Wa Al-Malaku Saffaan Saffaan","w":[["wajāa","And comes"],["rabbuka","your Lord"],["wal-malaku","and the Angels"],["ṣaffan","rank"],["ṣaffan","(upon) rank"]]},{"a":["وَجِاْيٓءَ","يَوۡمَئِذِۭ","بِجَهَنَّمَۚ","يَوۡمَئِذٖ","يَتَذَكَّرُ","ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ","وَأَنَّىٰ","لَهُ","ٱلذِّكۡرَىٰ"],"t":"And on that Day, Hell is brought forward. On that Day, man will remember, but how will remembrance avail him","l":"Wa Ji'a Yawma'idhin Bijahannama Yawma'idhin Yatadhakkaru Al-'Insanu Wa 'Anna Lahu Adh-Dhikra","w":[["wajīa","And is brought"],["yawma-idhin","that Day"],["bijahannama","Hell"],["yawma-idhin","That Day"],["yatadhakkaru","will remember"],["l-insānu","man"],["wa-annā","but how"],["lahu","(will be) for him"],["l-dhik'rā","the remembrance"]]},{"a":["يَقُولُ","يَٰلَيۡتَنِي","قَدَّمۡتُ","لِحَيَاتِي"],"t":"He will say, “If only I had forwarded for my life.”","l":"Yaqulu Ya Laytani Qaddamtu Lihayati","w":[["yaqūlu","He will say"],["yālaytanī","O I wish"],["qaddamtu","I had sent forth"],["liḥayātī","for my life"]]},{"a":["فَيَوۡمَئِذٖ","لَّا","يُعَذِّبُ","عَذَابَهُۥٓ","أَحَدٞ"],"t":"On that Day, none will punish as He punishes","l":"Fayawma'idhin La Yu`adhibu `Adhabahu 'Ahadun","w":[["fayawma-idhin","So that Day"],["lā","not"],["yuʿadhibu","will punish"],["ʿadhābahu","(as) His punishment"],["aḥadun","anyone"]]},{"a":["وَلَا","يُوثِقُ","وَثَاقَهُۥٓ","أَحَدٞ"],"t":"And none will shackle as He shackles","l":"Wa La Yuthiqu Wathaqahu 'Ahadun","w":[["walā","And not"],["yūthiqu","will bind"],["wathāqahu","(as) His binding"],["aḥadun","anyone"]]},{"a":["يَـٰٓأَيَّتُهَا","ٱلنَّفۡسُ","ٱلۡمُطۡمَئِنَّةُ"],"t":"But as for you, O tranquil soul","l":"Ya 'Ayyatuha An-Nafsu Al-Mutma'innahu","w":[["yāayyatuhā","O"],["l-nafsu","soul"],["l-muṭ'ma-inatu","who is satisfied"]]},{"a":["ٱرۡجِعِيٓ","إِلَىٰ","رَبِّكِ","رَاضِيَةٗ","مَّرۡضِيَّةٗ"],"t":"Return to your Lord, pleased and accepted","l":"Arji`i 'Ila Rabbiki Rađiyatan Marđiyahan","w":[["ir'jiʿī","Return"],["ilā","to"],["rabbiki","your Lord"],["rāḍiyatan","well pleased"],["marḍiyyatan","and pleasing"]]},{"a":["فَٱدۡخُلِي","فِي","عِبَٰدِي"],"t":"Enter among My servants","l":"Fadkhuli Fi `Ibadi","w":[["fa-ud'khulī","So enter"],["fī","among"],["ʿibādī","My slaves"]]},{"a":["وَٱدۡخُلِي","جَنَّتِي"],"t":"Enter My Paradise","l":"Wa Adkhuli Jannati","w":[["wa-ud'khulī","And enter"],["jannatī","My Paradise"]]}]}